00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:54.880
from absolute zero, no background, no

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:57.000
following, nothing, totally anonymous as

00:10:54.880 --> 00:11:00.080
well before, but within 29 days, he was

00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:01.760
hitting AdSense numbers of $214 in a

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:05.280
single day. And a few months in, he was

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:07.800
making $400 per day. Why? Because his

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:09.480
holy trifecta was dialed, right? We

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:10.720
obsessed over it on every video. The

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:12.080
ideas, the titles, the thumbnails were

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.440
solid, and most importantly, they were

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:15.120
congruent with each other. So, here's an

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.920
example, for instance, of the video that

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:18.520
did really well. We'll show the original

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:19.760
video that we found, and we'll show the

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.360
video that did really well. So, the way

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:23.080
to start is you would use the holy

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:25.880
trifecta skill, right? So, the holy

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:28.240
