intro. And the important thing is all of

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:55.880
these are going to be congruent with

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:57.320
each other. And then you just pick

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.600
whichever one is your favorite, and you

