don't have to make the thumbnail at this

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:02.240
point, but you can if you want to. And

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.600
then you line up a thumbnail, a title,

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:05.000
and an intro. And that is exactly what

